        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent transition hover:text-accent-hover"
      >
        &nbsp;Astro&nbsp;
      </a>
      · Alex Ye Lab
    </p>

    <div class="mt-2 flex justify-center gap-1">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/AlexYe1897"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center px-2 transition hover:text-accent"
        >GitHub</a
      >

      <a
        href="mailto:yejixuan1897@163.com"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center px-2 transition hover:text-accent"
        >Email</a
      >

      <a
